<title>JAPAN: Mori Denki ask-only on new share issue delay.</title>
<headline>Mori Denki ask-only on new share issue delay.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Mori Denki Manufacturing Co Ltd were ask only in early Tuesday morning trade, after the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said it planned to delay the firm's new share issuance, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0046 GMT, the shares were ask-only at 630 yen. On Monday, the shares closed at 650 yen.</p>
<p>On Monday, the TSE said it had postponed Mori Denki's planned new share issue by one month until December 19.</p>
</text>
